  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "生命趨勢與管理",
    "sub_ename": "LIFE TREND AND MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "員工是公司最重要的資產，因此，企業若欲維持永續經營與發展，就必須透過管理以確保公司內員工的身心健康。本課程的目標為傳授學員身體健康診斷、常見疾病與預防以及正向面對與治療等與健康相關之知識，以利企業化健康管理之執行。",
    "describe_eh": "Employees are the company's most important asset. Therefore, if a company wants to maintain sustainable operation and development, it must ensure the physical and mental health of its employees through management. The purpose of this course is to teach students health-related knowledge, such as physical health diagnosis, common diseases and prevention, and positive confrontation and medical  treatment, so as to facilitate the implementation of corporate health management.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
